    "source_record": "The municipal 4C009 is a group. A dated street photograph shows the No. 17 plate and the timber-framed pebble-dash gable immediately east of the passage. The same upper sills intersect in the 2020 public street panoramas. The western wing of owner 251 is recessed by 3.23 m in the original mesh. Owners 487, 3281 and the St Nicholas church 2197 remain separately identified."
